docs {
  Fetch epoch information. Omit `epoch` in the request to get the current
  epoch.

  **Service:** `sui.rpc.v2.LedgerService` · **Method:** `GetEpoch` (unary)

  **Request fields:**
  - `epoch` (optional uint64): the requested epoch. If omitted, the
    current epoch is returned.
  - `read_mask` (optional FieldMask): defaults to `epoch`. Other useful
    paths include `committee` (validator committee for the epoch) and
    `system_state`.

  Note: requesting `committee` returns the full validator set including
  raw public key bytes — the response can be large.

  Verified against `sui-mainnet.g.alchemy.com`.
}
